        rdfs:comment        "A regulated balance between cell survival and cell death is essential for normal development and homeostasis of multicellular organisms. Defects in control of this balance may contribute to autoimmune disease, neurodegeneration, ischemia/reperfusion injury, non alcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH) and cancer." ;
